{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_04",
  "title": "秉燭",
  "storyCode": "IW-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "dbf8bb0a5c373fcbd650034542509696cfcd343f01a7c1f6c3e92ff3016a1970",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "4下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "今天還真是一無所獲......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......在龍門的偵探事務所待著的時候，不會這麼麻煩的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "是梁大人給你的線索太少了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "不，因為我在龍門......有很多朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "而我在尚蜀的朋友，除了那位足不出戶的梁大人，就只剩您啦，慎師傅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "門口是不是站了太多人了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "他們可沒打算藏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的路人",
      "text": "......喂，那個龍門人也在這兒，對......別輕舉妄動，別讓他們離開就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的路人",
      "text": "看好他們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唉，我們這算是自投羅網了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......奇怪，他們過去再怎麼風光，如今也不過開幾家飯館酒樓而已，真有這麼多人能攀上關係？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的過客",
      "text": "這周圍沒其他——等、等等！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的路人們",
      "text": "尚......尚師傅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......坐，請坐。喝杯茶？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......我打聽過了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "有這麼幾個地方，人跡罕至，但有一些古時候留下來的亭子，我都替你標在地圖上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "至於賣酒水的地方，但凡有村落的，九成都有賣酒的鋪子。硬要說，這幾處都符合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "取江峰邊有一處？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......我是沒印象。不過告訴我的老錢，非說有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "這些地方，都是偏僻山路。尋常遊客不會走的，要注意安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "原來如此，多謝尚師傅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......那我走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "尚師傅，您和門外那些人......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的路人們",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......不熟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的路人",
      "text": "怎、怎麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的路人",
      "text": "（快去告訴掌櫃的......尚師傅和這個龍門人有來往！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的過客",
      "text": "（那我們還堵門嗎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的路人",
      "text": "（堵啥呀，先撤吧，走走走。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你回了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "徒勞無功，梁大人就別問了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "我只是擔心有賊人惦記你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......只要梁大人還惦記著賊人，賊人就不敢惦記我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "何況，這燙手酒盞也不在我手裡了，梁大人反倒該小心才是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......無妨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "襲擊你的人查到了，一場誤會，將你誤認為偷竊文物的走私販。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "看來尚蜀俠風仍在啊。只是“誤會”，就如此大打出手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你就莫怪他們了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "慎師傅，老鯉他畢竟不是本地人，這些天，恐怕都要麻煩你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "沒有的事，聽您吩咐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "正是碼頭繁忙的時候，這些日子落下的工錢，我會加倍付給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "別，梁大人，咱們可是向來不談錢的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "可我卻是不能虧待百姓的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你幫過我太多了，也許以後還需要你幫我更多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......好。既然梁大人有這個心，我也就不推辭了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "這些時日，我都陪著鯉小子就是，尚蜀三山十七峰，挑山走水兩路人，門清。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "有勞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "——梁洵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "怎麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我們屋裡說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我還記得先前我說過，只要梁大人沒有事情瞞著我，這件事就不複雜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "告訴我，這隻酒盞，和它的主人，藏了多大秘密？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "你不能說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "不能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "今天我在山上，又遇到那夥人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "所以你那個所謂的“誤會”，實在沒有什麼說服力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "牽扯多大？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "天大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "那你該早點告訴我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "我怕你知道太多，反而被牽扯其中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "難道我現在沒有被牽扯其中嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你好好歇息，若是實在難尋......也就算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "都到這一步了，你總不能突然心裡有愧吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "好意心領了。我如果真的算了，你肯定沒好日子過，我清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "那這件事究竟牽扯什麼？總能說說吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "關乎民生社稷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "確實天大，就是突然這麼玄乎，讓人不可置信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "我從不拿這些開玩笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......我當然知道梁大人從不拿這些事情開玩笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "那容我換個問題，今晚總不會還有姑娘來找你吧，梁大人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "——咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......我與寧小姐確實沒什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我還沒說你倆有什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你眼神可不是這麼說的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "當真？你梁洵雖然天天被嘲諷是個木頭人，但是槐天裴的女兒都這麼大了，你總不能還沒開竅吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "有苦衷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......喝酒嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "我總該陪你喝一杯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......好吧，對，你總該陪我喝一杯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "克洛絲姐姐的身手果然夠快，看來掌櫃的所言非虛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "那位使扇子的小哥呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "萬一有什麼陷阱，總不能眼睜睜看著全軍覆沒吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......真稀奇，我本以為克洛絲姐姐該派那個小哥來，自己則躲在暗處等待才是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "常言道丟車保帥，克洛絲姐姐不僅是那個“帥”，更是個本就擅長逃脫的弩手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "儘管如此，你還是親自來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "誰叫小烏有還不是我們的正式幹員呢，總不能把他往火坑裡推吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "就算是，我想克洛絲姐姐也會隻身犯險吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "如果您喜歡透過“我一眼把你看穿了”來顯得自己很聰明，那我能不能先回去休息休息？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......哈哈，真性情，那就當我說廢話了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "直說吧，我們稍微調查了一下羅德島，時間倉促，沒太多訊息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "克洛絲姐姐的為人，我已經初見一二。不敢說什麼瞭解，但我是信得過的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......信得過？我不僅摻和了你們的事情，而且還是個感染者喔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "良才善用，能者居之，礦石病是每個感染者個人的不幸，與他們的責任或能力何干？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "我想讓羅德島幫我們一個忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "不，換句話說，羅德島如果不幫這個忙，就算是和我們作對了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "你想要鯉先生的盞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "那夜離開梁府後，蹤跡就變成了兩個人，夜色濃，你們動作很快，但我始終盯著其中一個——從梁府離開的那個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "不過很快我就跟丟了，然後出現在我面前的，彷彿是一個故意要把我引開的人——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "那個客棧老闆把我引開，是為了掩護你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "不枉掌櫃的對你如此高看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......那就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "那隻盞和“歲”有什麼關係？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "你知道“歲”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......呵......看來克洛絲姐姐雖然沒說謊，可話只說了一半。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "唔，有嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "豈止是你們把年和夕當作了朋友......既然她連這些事情都告訴你們，那她們分明是把羅德島當成了救命稻草。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "要是放在幾十年幾百年前，她們如何行動，但凡沒有壞了規矩，那司歲台根本不會理睬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "可如今不同了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "不光時局變化，你們與年交好，還擅自將夕帶離了山頭，這件事讓司歲台大為光火。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我們只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "我知道你們是無意的，可下一步呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "大炎要怎麼確定，她們聚在一起，沒有什麼驚天的陰謀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......“大炎”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......我可不是在危言聳聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "年和夕在靠近尚蜀之後便不知所蹤，而恰好此時，出現了一隻與她們都有關係的酒盞，而這一切的相關人，又都在“羅德島”身邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "這實在是巧得不能再巧了。你說是吧，克洛絲姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "而我相信，天底下沒有這麼巧的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "......哎喲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "衣服洗了忘記晾了。糟糟糟......今天不晾，明天沒得換洗了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "......尚塚啊，你不該來這裡的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "趕緊走啦，走我就當沒看見啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "今天有個年輕人，讓我在山上找亭子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "......大夥都知道你離開的時候情形複雜，但是沒個交代，還暗算掌櫃的，按規矩你就是叛徒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "然後你們的人把他圍了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "叛徒大哥，尚大哥，我求求你，被別人看到，我就只能動手了喔？傷和氣的喔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "他是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "大哥！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我問你他是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "......是個龍門人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "是生意而已，和外人無關，無可奉告。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......等今年過了，就十年整了。我打算最近就給鏢局一個交代。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我給你們一個交代。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "也是找鄭清鉞做個了斷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "我還是不能告訴你啊，尚大哥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "劉二！當年是誰把你從火裡救出來的！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "我不能說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......和那隻酒盞有關，對不對？和十年前那隻酒盞有關，對不對？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......看來是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "那些年輕人嘴裡說的“酒盞”，果然就是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "喂，你不是私下逼問了年輕的學徒吧——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......天意啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客棧夥計",
      "text": "——喂，尚塚！問完就走啊，講不講情義啊！喂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哈，酒量到底還是變了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "要是以前的梁洵，現在早該往桌子下鑽了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "偶爾獨酌，久而久之。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "不愧是梁大人，當了官還有閒情獨酌——等等，你這所謂的偶爾獨酌，該不會是因為？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "愁更愁罷了，人之常情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......人們也常說，一個人酒量變了，人也就變了。你覺得有道理不？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "不無道理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唉，杯中物杯中物，杯中裝的是人情世故啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "實話說，這次來尚蜀見你，我心裡驚訝不小。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "嗯，為何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "誰讓我只認識那個一板一眼，不苟言笑的梁洵呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我還記得在學校的時候，先師閣外邊，你曾說要為天下人謀福，你說大地淒苦寒涼，就讓天下人共生火共取熱，再見不到半點黑暗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......年輕時的豪言壯語，也是梁某人一直用以自省的初心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "很多年前啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "是很多年了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你也已經不是當年那個風流瀟灑的大少爺了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "虛度光陰罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......離家這麼久，可有和家人聯絡過？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我剛出家門沒多久呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你是說，龍門那偵探事務所，如今才是你的家？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "那江東那邊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "只是一座宅邸，幾掛燈籠，些許故人罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......你我都變了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "但願我們如今碰杯，聽見的不是過去凌雲意氣破碎的聲響。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "不不不，也不對，如今梁大人官拜四品，乃是一城知府，既然百姓對你滿意，你豈非已經達成昔日願景了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "路還長。尚蜀本就生機勃勃，梁某做的事，不過錦上添花。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "那就還望梁大人不忘初心，乾杯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "乾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "大炎的神秘學研究始終是這片大地最深邃的秘密。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "可別說得好像是我們不願意分享似的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "雖然形式各不相同，但是大地各國確實也在用自己的方式去對待同樣的問題。擺在大地上的問題總是一致的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "只不過，出於某些......歷史原因。在“巨獸學”這方面，放眼泰拉，大炎司歲台只會是一枝獨秀，過去是，未來也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "在謝拉格還將它們當作神明崇拜，在薩米依舊與它們共存的現今，司歲台的研究，早已極深研幾，無微不至。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "所以，司歲台的“歲”字，是年提起過的那個“歲”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "年告訴過你那些傳說嗎？古代帝皇、圍獵、崛起之物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "（是小炎熔說的那些......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "曾被古時候的人們普遍認作“神明”的某種生物，隨著文明興起，它們逐漸隱匿了身形。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "所謂的“歲”，就是其中之一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "“某種生物”......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "關於它們是否符合生物的定義，我想我們沒必要空費口舌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "只需要知道，當它們禍國殃民的時刻，大炎有能力消滅它們，這就足夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......挺有道理的呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "這些雖然稱不上司歲台機密，可終歸也不是什麼眾人皆知的知識。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "告訴克洛絲姐姐這些，可不是打算搞什麼學術會談啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......年，夕，還有躲在尚蜀某處的那一位。這些傢夥始終在司歲台的監視之下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "本來，任何事情都不會倉促到如此地步，直到有天，那座山頭突然雲開霧散，等到司歲台秉燭人趕到時，夕早已不見蹤影。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "沒幾天前的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "司歲台的秉燭人們將此事回報給朝廷，也沒花幾天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......了不起，灰齊山離大炎首都有相當遠的距離吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "羅德島是在不知全貌的情況下介入此事，不知者無罪。可反過來說，一無所知，還敢與那兩人共事，實在匪夷所思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "現在，我們希望羅德島能遵循司歲台的安排，說服那龍門人，將酒盞主動交還給我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......果然，梁洵從一開始就接到了你們的命令。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "他讓鯉先生把東西從龍門送來，然後假裝被搶走，暗度陳倉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "你直呼知府名諱，卻依舊稱那龍門人為“先生”，說明你確實是個好人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "“好人”在炎國話裡有別的意思嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "別誤會，我沒那麼拐彎抹角，只是說你毫不掩飾對那龍門人的信任罷了。是因為那人和羅德島有合作關係嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "其實也不止是普通的合作關係啦......也是朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......朋友總是不多的。年和夕，似乎也是你的朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "聽你說的話，司歲台在大炎似乎地位崇高，那你們刻意演這齣戲，到底要掩誰的耳目？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "這恐怕就超過羅德島需要知道的範疇了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "承認得這麼坦蕩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "又不是什麼見不得人的事情，只不過礙於官場顏面，做得討巧罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "好了，告訴了羅德島如此多的事，接下來，是不是能放下成見談合作了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......你要羅德島幫你們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "也讓鯉先生好做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "除歲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......我沒醉，不用這麼扶著我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你是客人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我只是被你從龍門使喚過來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "其實我有想過，信使到了龍門，未必能找到你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我在龍門註冊那個事務所的時候，其實想著的，就是能被你們找到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "“鯉氏”，可你為何突然想到要在龍門安身立業？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "誰叫那裡已經是大炎最靠邊的地方了呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "再往外......我就無處可去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......你可以回來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "不想回了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "梁洵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我其實知道的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你一向都是知道的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "龍門終究不是你的家，你卻期盼了龍門半輩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我以為在那裡，我就能找到我一直想做的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你找到了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "找到了，可我發現其實在哪裡，我都能找到它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "當年槐天裴說自己習武，便要爭個天下聞名。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "當年梁洵想為天下人多做些事，想教這世道不必再使人擔驚受怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......你呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "當年我只是一尾過江鱗。不過躍出水面幾分，便以為天高地闊，皆是我鄉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "睏了睏了，明天還要勞累，你先走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "保重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......酒沒剩下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "故人，故人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "......一記妙手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "我已經落了下風，是不是就不必繼續下去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "text": "不必繼續下去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "文人四藝，琴棋書畫。你總不能次次挑著“棋”字與我較勁，這不是欺負人嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "text": "做人還是要懂得揚長避短。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "text": "詩詞歌賦，我又有哪樣比得過你呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "又感到無趣了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "text": "太平盛世。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "text": "可這太平盛世，只是大炎的太平盛世。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "你的子，可落不在大炎之外的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "text": "是，我的棋盤只在大炎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "text": "可每盤棋的手談之人，未必在我。那其他棋局，也就在大地各處。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "他們能與你有關嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "text": "觀棋不語真君子，落子無悔大丈夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "......你就只是看看。看著那些人類......紛爭中的人類，糾纏中的人類。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "text": "只是靠觀棋悟棋道罷了，懵懂孩童都是從模仿學起的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "可你不是他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......什麼意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "你是......哦，你手裡握著他的一枚子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "那麼，你替他下棋？來自龍門的鯉先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "什......我......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "唔。這可......稀奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "他為什麼要將你一個尋常人拉進局中？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "不，還是說，他沒有刻意選擇你，他只是算到了，任何人任何事，都遲早會促成如今這個結果？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "你在說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "我在說，你並非那個已經萬念俱灰的人。但你卻坐在了他的位置上，與我下棋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......你是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "令。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "這是哪兒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "一個......百年前的夢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "有些玩笑了，我如何夢見一個百年前的夢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "是啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的夢中人",
      "text": "你如何夢見的呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唔......好像做了個不得了的夢......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窗外的聲音",
      "text": "站住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......這聲音......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
